WEBVTT

1
00:00:45.333 --> 00:00:49.541


2
00:00:49.541 --> 00:00:52.958
<b>Here Sanjaya narrates to Dhritarashtra:</b>

3
00:00:52.958 --> 00:00:58.416
<b>Upon Gudakesha Arjuna's request,</b>
<b>Hrishikesha Lord Krishna </b>

4
00:00:58.416 --> 00:01:00.958
<b>drove the chariot into the center</b>
<b>of the battlefield,</b>

5
00:01:00.958 --> 00:01:07.125
<b>right before Bhishma, Drona,</b>
<b>and all the other kings. </b>

6
00:01:07.125 --> 00:01:09.083
<b>Then Krishna said to Arjuna, </b>

7
00:01:09.083 --> 00:01:10.333
<b>"O Partha,</b>

8
00:01:10.333 --> 00:01:15.416
<b>behold all the Kauravas</b>
<b>gathered here for battle."</b>

9
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:20.125


10
00:01:20.125 --> 00:01:23.291
<b>Lord Krishna, as Arjuna's charioteer,</b>

11
00:01:23.291 --> 00:01:24.791
<b>upon receiving the command,</b>

12
00:01:24.791 --> 00:01:29.416
<b>swiftly steered the white-horsed chariot</b>
<b>into the middle of the battlefield. </b>

13
00:01:29.416 --> 00:01:30.500
<b>And here,</b>

14
00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:33.791
<b>a glimpse of Lord Krishna's</b>
<b>divine play is revealed...</b>

15
00:01:33.791 --> 00:01:35.666
<b>This was no mere coincidence;</b>

16
00:01:35.666 --> 00:01:41.416
<b>He deliberately positioned the chariot</b>
<b>right in front of Bhishma and Drona. </b>

17
00:01:41.416 --> 00:01:44.916
<b>Lord Krishna is omniscient.</b>

18
00:01:44.916 --> 00:01:46.166
<b>He knew</b>

19
00:01:46.166 --> 00:01:52.333
<b>that in the Kaurava army, Arjuna's heart was filled</b>
<b>with boundless love and reverence for these two.</b>

20
00:01:52.333 --> 00:01:56.250
<b>Arjuna won’t raise weapons against them.</b>

21
00:01:56.250 --> 00:02:00.000
<b>The very thought of battling against his</b>
<b>grandsire Bhishma and guru Drona</b>

22
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.625
<b>would leave Arjuna distraught.</b>

23
00:02:02.625 --> 00:02:06.375
<b>And it is this very anguish that will</b>
<b>ignite Arjuna's doubts,</b>

24
00:02:06.375 --> 00:02:08.375
<b>and to quell them,</b>

25
00:02:08.375 --> 00:02:11.000
<b>the Gita's teachings will manifest.</b>

26
00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:12.375
<b>And these divine instructions</b>

27
00:02:12.375 --> 00:02:18.875
<b>will guide not only Arjuna,</b>
<b>but the entire world for eternity.</b>

28
00:02:18.875 --> 00:02:22.625
<b>Here, Arjuna is addressed as Gudakesha</b>

29
00:02:22.625 --> 00:02:27.000
<b>the one who has conquered</b>
<b>over sleep and ignorance.</b>

30
00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:29.416
<b>And how will this victory be achieved?</b>

31
00:02:29.416 --> 00:02:32.041
<b>Through the guidance of Lord Krishna,</b>

32
00:02:32.041 --> 00:02:35.625
<b>who is referred to as Hrishikesha</b>

33
00:02:35.625 --> 00:02:39.500
<b>the supreme master of the senses and the mind. </b>

34
00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:44.500
<b>The one who reads Arjuna's thoughts, </b>
<b>agitates his mind, </b>

35
00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:48.666
<b>and will also pacify it</b>

36
00:02:48.916 --> 00:02:53.083


37
00:02:53.083 --> 00:02:56.916
<b>The battle had not even begun,</b>

38
00:02:56.916 --> 00:03:04.666
<b>yet I positioned Arjuna face-to-face</b>

39
00:03:04.666 --> 00:03:07.375
<b>But why?</b>

40
00:03:07.375 --> 00:03:08.791
<b>Observe, </b>

41
00:03:08.791 --> 00:03:17.625
<b>When a potter kneads clay to make a pot,</b>
<b>he meticulously works the clay for a long time </b>

42
00:03:17.625 --> 00:03:26.583
<b>to ensure, not even a tiny air bubble remains.</b>

43
00:03:26.583 --> 00:03:29.416
<b>Then when the pot is fired in the kiln,</b>

44
00:03:29.416 --> 00:03:31.000
<b>when baked,</b>

45
00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:36.333
<b>that little air bubble itself can damage the pot </b>

46
00:03:36.333 --> 00:03:39.208
<b>or break it.</b>

47
00:03:39.208 --> 00:03:41.125
<b>So my friends,</b>

48
00:03:41.125 --> 00:03:43.708
<b>Similar to these bubbles, </b>

49
00:03:43.708 --> 00:03:46.541
<b>are our doubts.</b>

50
00:03:46.541 --> 00:03:49.833
<b>That in the future, can break us,</b>

51
00:03:49.833 --> 00:03:51.916
<b>make us weak. </b>

52
00:03:51.916 --> 00:03:59.000
<b>In this great war, Arjuna’s mental stability</b>
<b>will be of utmost importance.</b>

53
00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:03.916
<b>Before advancing towards any major goal,</b>

54
00:04:03.916 --> 00:04:06.958
<b>thorough preparation is necessary. </b>

55
00:04:06.958 --> 00:04:14.541
<b>It's crucial to knead the clay of</b>
<b>our mind like a potter, </b>

56
00:04:14.541 --> 00:04:19.833
<b>to question and answer ourselves </b>

57
00:04:19.833 --> 00:04:28.250
<b>until all doubts in the mind are dispelled</b>
<b>and do not obstruct the path ahead.</b>

58
00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:30.875
<b>You have the full potential</b>

59
00:04:30.875 --> 00:04:36.583
<b>to overcome every doubt,</b>
<b>every dilemma within you. </b>

60
00:04:36.583 --> 00:04:37.750
<b>Yes,</b>

61
00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:43.750
<b>sometimes the mind will need a charioteer.</b>

62
00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:48.208
<b>I was Arjuna's guide,</b>

63
00:04:48.208 --> 00:04:50.791
<b>and I shall be yours too,</b>

64
00:04:50.791 --> 00:04:54.041
<b>through the medium of the Gita,</b>

65
00:04:54.041 --> 00:04:55.791
<b>if you so desire.</b>

66
00:04:56.291 --> 00:05:00.416


67
00:05:00.416 --> 00:05:02.000
<b>In this society,</b>

68
00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:06.791
<b>no unit is more important than family.</b>

69
00:05:06.791 --> 00:05:12.833
<b>It is family that gives us the strength</b>
<b>to accomplish great deeds.</b>

70
00:05:12.833 --> 00:05:15.500
<b>It is family that becomes our support,</b>

71
00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:22.500
<b>a support we can rely on in times of doubt.</b>

72
00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:24.666
<b>However,</b>

73
00:05:24.666 --> 00:05:28.958
<b>this same family can also become</b>
<b>our greatest weakness,</b>

74
00:05:28.958 --> 00:05:35.166
<b>as will happen with</b>
<b>Arjuna when he sees his relatives here.</b>

75
00:05:35.166 --> 00:05:39.875
<b>If someone is striving to achieve their goals, </b>

76
00:05:39.875 --> 00:05:43.708
<b>and their elders show disbelief in them,</b>

77
00:05:43.708 --> 00:05:45.541
<b>criticizing them,</b>

78
00:05:45.541 --> 00:05:49.291
<b>it can shatter that person's resolve.</b>

79
00:05:49.291 --> 00:05:51.000
<b>Yes!</b>

80
00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:52.666
<b>It is natural </b>

81
00:05:52.666 --> 00:05:57.333
<b>that we do not want to see our loved ones fall, </b>

82
00:05:57.333 --> 00:06:01.000
<b>but in trying to keep them safe, </b>

83
00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:06.250
<b>sometimes we inadvertently weaken them.</b>

84
00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:10.708
<b>What matters is not that we always</b>
<b>keep them protected, </b>

85
00:06:10.708 --> 00:06:13.291
<b>shielding them from all risks.</b>

86
00:06:13.291 --> 00:06:17.916
<b>What matters is</b>
<b>that we instill self-confidence in them, </b>

87
00:06:17.916 --> 00:06:24.041
<b>so that they can overcome</b>
<b>those risks on their own.</b>

88
00:06:24.041 --> 00:06:30.250
<b>A ship that fears to set sail for fear of sinking,</b>

89
00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:34.041
<b>Then what kind of ship is that? </b>

90
00:06:34.041 --> 00:06:37.625
<b>It will simply gather rust standing at the shore.</b>

91
00:06:37.625 --> 00:06:40.583
<b>Yes!</b>

92
00:06:40.583 --> 00:06:45.458
<b>Disagreements can certainly arise,</b>

93
00:06:45.458 --> 00:06:48.333
<b>where our experience says one thing</b>

94
00:06:48.333 --> 00:06:50.833
<b>and their enthusiasm says another.</b>

95
00:06:50.833 --> 00:06:55.916
<b>Even then, pulling them down is not right.</b>

96
00:06:55.916 --> 00:06:57.375
<b>The right approach</b>

97
00:06:57.375 --> 00:06:59.958
<b>is to have a conversation,</b>

98
00:06:59.958 --> 00:07:02.791
<b>to express our doubts</b>

99
00:07:02.791 --> 00:07:06.000
<b>and then listen calmly,</b>

100
00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:07.916
<b>to offer them suggestions.</b>

101
00:07:07.916 --> 00:07:09.583
<b>Ultimately,</b>

102
00:07:09.583 --> 00:07:12.208
<b>this journey is theirs,</b>

103
00:07:12.208 --> 00:07:15.083
<b>and they must traverse it,</b>

104
00:07:15.083 --> 00:07:17.250
<b>just as </b>

105
00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:21.375
<b>Arjuna must fight this battle himself. </b>

106
00:07:21.375 --> 00:07:26.666
<b>I am merely bringing to light</b>
<b>the questions hidden in his mind, </b>

107
00:07:26.666 --> 00:07:29.041
<b>and I will help him</b>

108
00:07:29.041 --> 00:07:31.708
<b>find the answers.</b>

109
00:07:31.708 --> 00:07:33.750
<b>And,</b>

110
00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:36.208
<b>I will continue to help you too.</b>

111
00:07:36.833 --> 00:07:41.083


112
00:07:41.083 --> 00:07:46.458
<b>What sets truly successful people apart? </b>

113
00:07:46.458 --> 00:07:50.291
<b>Do they not have any flaws?</b>

114
00:07:50.291 --> 00:07:51.583
<b>They do. </b>

115
00:07:51.583 --> 00:07:56.375
<b>Even the most successful person in the world</b>

116
00:07:56.375 --> 00:08:00.083
<b>The difference is simply</b>

117
00:08:00.083 --> 00:08:03.791
<b>that these people engage in self-reflection; </b>

118
00:08:03.791 --> 00:08:07.541
<b>they are well aware of their weaknesses.</b>

119
00:08:07.541 --> 00:08:11.250
<b>By doing so, they can improve themselves,</b>

120
00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:16.041
<b>or find other means to compensate</b>
<b>for those weaknesses.</b>

121
00:08:16.041 --> 00:08:17.208
<b>But</b>

122
00:08:17.208 --> 00:08:19.916
<b>all of this can only happen</b>

123
00:08:19.916 --> 00:08:23.875
<b>when they are aware of it, right?</b>

124
00:08:23.875 --> 00:08:25.083
<b>Hmmm,</b>

125
00:08:25.083 --> 00:08:28.375
<b>So become aware.</b>

126
00:08:28.375 --> 00:08:29.875
<b>Engaging in self-reflection,</b>

127
00:08:29.875 --> 00:08:31.750
<b>understanding your strengths,</b>

128
00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:34.791
<b>recognizing your weaknesses,</b>

129
00:08:34.791 --> 00:08:37.333
<b>and striving to overcome them</b>

130
00:08:37.333 --> 00:08:41.416
<b>herein lies the key to professional success.</b>

131
00:08:41.416 --> 00:08:47.416
<b>Continuously endeavor to understand</b>
<b>your state of mind.</b>

132
00:08:47.416 --> 00:08:50.083
<b>Just as a gymnasium</b>

133
00:08:50.083 --> 00:08:53.375
<b>makes your body healthy,</b>

134
00:08:53.375 --> 00:08:56.791
<b>contemplation strengthens the mind.</b>

135
00:08:56.791 --> 00:08:59.416
<b>You could say</b>

136
00:08:59.416 --> 00:09:02.958
<b>that this Gita is your mental gymnasium,</b>

137
00:09:02.958 --> 00:09:05.791
<b>and I am your instructor.</b>

138
00:09:05.791 --> 00:09:10.291
<b>Would you like to undertake</b>
<b>this mental exercise?</b>

